# PalmPay design system

## Theme modes
- **Default:** `ThemeMode.light`
- **Toggle:** Profile → More → Appearance (Light / Dark / System)
- **Persistence:** `shared_preferences` key `palmpay_theme_mode`
- **Implementation:** `themeModeProvider` + `AppTheme.light` / `AppTheme.dark`

## Brand palette (`context.pp` via `PalmPayPalette`)
| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `primary` / `mint` | `#00C896` | Balance card accent, active nav, Send & Request |
| `accent` / `actionBlue` | `#3D8BFF` | Load Money tile, secondary actions |
| `onBalanceCard` | white | Text on balance card |
| `balanceGradient` | `#12352C` → `#151B24` | Balance card background |

## Dark mode surfaces
- Background `#0B0F14`, surface `#151B24`, elevated `#1E2733`, border `#2A3444`

## Home layout
- Row: **balance card (left, ~60%)** + **Load Money (accent blue) / Send & Request (primary green) stacked (right)**
- Section: **Transactions** with See all
- Section: **Discover** horizontal promo cards
- Action tiles must scale text with `FittedBox` to avoid overflow on narrow screens

## Code rules
1. Use `context.pp` and `Theme.of(context).colorScheme` — not hardcoded hex
2. Text: `AppTextStyles.title(context)` etc. (theme-aware)
3. Never reintroduce global dark-only scaffold without dark theme pair
